{"lang": "zh_CN", "eventid": "act52side", "eventName": "昨日海", "entryType": "ACTIVITY", "storyCode": "YW-ST-3", "avgTag": "幕间", "storyName": "留给明天", "storyInfo": "岛民与伊比利亚人的矛盾暂时缓和。克莱门莎正式辞去阿戈尔的职务，留在伊比利亚，并招募与她合作的德鲁莎，组建了陆巡队。", "storyList": [{"id": 0, "prop": "HEADER", "attributes": {"key": "title_test", "is_skippable": "true", "fit_mode": "BLACK_MASK"}}, {"id": 1, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 2, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 3, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 4, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 5, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 6, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$blizzard", "volume": 0.0, "channel": "f", "loop": "true"}}, {"id": 7, "prop": "SoundVolume", "attributes": {"volume": 0.5, "channel": "f", "fadetime": 1.0}}, {"id": 8, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_sea", "volume": 0.0, "channel": "sea", "loop": "true"}}, {"id": 9, "prop": "SoundVolume", "attributes": {"volume": 1.0, "channel": "sea", "fadetime": 1.0}}, {"id": 10, "prop": "Subtitle", "attributes": {"text": "“那风暴真是让人永生难忘，有这座广场几十倍大的漩涡掀起了比我背后的起重机还高的巨浪。”", "multi": "true", "x": 300.0, "y": 350.0, "alignment": "center", "size": 24.0, "delay": 0.04, "width": 700.0}}, {"id": 11, "prop": "subtitle", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 12, "prop": "Subtitle", "attributes": {"text": "“那些被怪物玷污过的海水，每溅起一次，就把天空都染黑一番，到最后，天和海一片墨色——”", "multi": "true", "x": 300.0, "y": 350.0, "alignment": "center", "size": 24.0, "delay": 0.04, "width": 700.0}}, {"id": 13, "prop": "subtitle", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 14, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 15, "prop": "Image", "attributes": {"image": "74_i04", "screenadapt": "coverall", "xScale": 1.1, "yScale": 1.1, "fadetime": 0.0}}, {"id": 16, "prop": "ImageTween", "attributes": {"xScaleFrom": 1.05, "yScaleFrom": 1.05, "xScaleTo": 1.0, "yScaleTo": 1.0, "duration": 20.0, "block": "false"}}, {"id": 17, "prop": "playMusic", "attributes": {"key": "$m_avg_barcarolle_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 18, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "false"}}, {"id": 19, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 20, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "咳咳！", "name": "特菲"}}, {"id": 21, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "就是在那样的风暴当中，我埃斯特菲尼娅·科隆·德·托莱多，带领着这片土地上最勇敢的人们，找到了港都中心城区。", "name": "特菲"}}, {"id": 22, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "王室海军的后裔也好，普通捕鳞人的孩子也好，在那一刻，都是伟大的人。就连我们的岛民朋友也不例外……", "name": "特菲"}}, {"id": 23, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 24, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 25, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 26, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 27, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 1.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 28, "prop": "Image", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 29, "prop": "StopSound", "attributes": {"channel": "f", "fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 30, "prop": "StopSound", "attributes": {"channel": "sea", "fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 31, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 32, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 33, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "74_g5_gdsquare_d", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 34, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 1.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 35, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 36, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 37, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4009_irene_1#6$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 38, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "埃斯特菲尼娅还是这样，她讲的故事甚至更夸张了。", "name": "艾丽妮"}, "figure_art": "avg_4009_irene_1#6$1"}, {"id": 39, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#2$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 40, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "任谁经历了前几天的打捞，恐怕都会把自己亲眼目睹的事迹编成故事的。", "name": "纳乔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4232_hbound_1#2$1"}, {"id": 41, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 42, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "艾丽妮长官，我约您来就是想问问，那些曾经参与袭击的同胞……", "name": "纳乔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4232_hbound_1#1$1"}, {"id": 43, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4009_irene_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 44, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "塔西塔小姐已经在处理一些岛民寻求阿戈尔庇护的申请，只要犯罪情节不重，他们很快就能回到自己的家乡。", "name": "艾丽妮"}, "figure_art": "avg_4009_irene_1#1$1"}, {"id": 45, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4009_irene_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 46, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "那些仍在暗处对伊比利亚心怀怨恨的岛民，我们无法平息他们的怒火，但他们若打算对伊比利亚不利，我们一定不会手下留情。", "name": "艾丽妮"}, "figure_art": "avg_4009_irene_1#1$1"}, {"id": 47, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4009_irene_1#7$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 48, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "至于那些曾经想要挟持港都中心城区，最后又参与打捞的岛民，审判庭已经对他们下达了判决。", "name": "艾丽妮"}, "figure_art": "avg_4009_irene_1#7$1"}, {"id": 49, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#3$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 50, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "他、他们会怎么样……", "name": "纳乔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4232_hbound_1#3$1"}, {"id": 51, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4009_irene_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 52, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "他们将在港都“服役”。", "name": "艾丽妮"}, "figure_art": "avg_4009_irene_1#1$1"}, {"id": 53, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4009_irene_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 54, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "他们将用自己的双手建设这座他们的祖辈建造的城市，让它变得更像岛民心中的样子，也变得更好。", "name": "艾丽妮"}, "figure_art": "avg_4009_irene_1#1$1"}, {"id": 55, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4009_irene_1#6$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 56, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "毕竟现在，这里在海图上的代号是“我们的伊比利亚”。", "name": "艾丽妮"}, "figure_art": "avg_4009_irene_1#6$1"}, {"id": 57, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#6$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 58, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "呼……您吓到我了。", "name": "纳乔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4232_hbound_1#6$1"}, {"id": 59, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4009_irene_1#6$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 60, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "被深海主教用海嗣做手术的时候都不害怕，现在倒害怕了？", "name": "艾丽妮"}, "figure_art": "avg_4009_irene_1#6$1"}, {"id": 61, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#4$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 62, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "您知道了？！", "name": "纳乔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4232_hbound_1#4$1"}, {"id": 63, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4009_irene_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 64, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "放心，克莱门莎监事已经向审判庭解释了原委，而且现在海嗣已经被剥离出你的义肢，它对你的身体不会造成任何影响了。", "name": "艾丽妮"}, "figure_art": "avg_4009_irene_1#1$1"}, {"id": 65, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#2$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 66, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "是啊，我终于能好好看一看这座城市——雷亚-伊比利亚，真不敢相信，它会成为我和一些同胞真正的家。", "name": "纳乔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4232_hbound_1#2$1"}, {"id": 67, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4009_irene_1#6$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 68, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "嗯，雷亚-伊比利亚与伊比利亚其他地方都不同，它将完全承认岛民的国民身份。", "name": "艾丽妮"}, "figure_art": "avg_4009_irene_1#6$1"}, {"id": 69, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4009_irene_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 70, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "而在伊比利亚的其他地方，哪怕重塑岛民的身份认同会遇到阻碍，审判庭也会这样去做。", "name": "艾丽妮"}, "figure_art": "avg_4009_irene_1#1$1"}, {"id": 71, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#2$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 72, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "谢谢您，也谢谢审判庭的努力。", "name": "纳乔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4232_hbound_1#2$1"}, {"id": 73, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4009_irene_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 74, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "职责所在。接下来想做什么？", "name": "艾丽妮"}, "figure_art": "avg_4009_irene_1#1$1"}, {"id": 75, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 76, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我会继续留在港都工作，有朝一日，我或许能亲眼看到，鲁菲纳奶奶寄托在那枚螺栓上的梦想究竟是什么样的。", "name": "纳乔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4232_hbound_1#1$1"}, {"id": 77, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#2$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 78, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "但在正式投入工作之前，我需要先处理义肢的修复问题。", "name": "纳乔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4232_hbound_1#2$1"}, {"id": 79, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#2$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 80, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "克莱门莎监事向我推荐了一家医药企业，听说他们能帮到我，那家企业好像叫……罗德岛？", "name": "纳乔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4232_hbound_1#2$1"}, {"id": 81, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 82, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 83, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……出海寻找港都中心城区的惩戒军和普通人即将被风暴吞没的关头，一双手、一盏灯，为他们指明了生路……", "name": "特菲"}}, {"id": 84, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "伊比利亚人永远不会抛弃自己的同胞。", "name": "特菲"}}, {"id": 85, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 86, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 87, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 88, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 89, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 90, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "74_g2_courtprison", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 91, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 92, "prop": "playMusic", "attributes": {"intro": "$drift_intro", "key": "$drift_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 93, "prop": "Subtitle", "attributes": {"text": "“恶人从未向他的同伴交付真心，他自始至终就只是想要熄灭伊比利亚的灯火。”", "multi": "true", "x": 300.0, "y": 350.0, "alignment": "center", "size": 24.0, "delay": 0.04, "width": 700.0}}, {"id": 94, "prop": "subtitle", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 95, "prop": "Subtitle", "attributes": {"text": "“但谁知道熄灭灯火的人，是不是想要点起另一把更烈的火？”", "multi": "true", "x": 300.0, "y": 350.0, "alignment": "center", "size": 24.0, "delay": 0.04, "width": 700.0}}, {"id": 96, "prop": "subtitle", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 97, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.5, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 98, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2266_1#10$1", "bstart": 0.2, "bend": 0.6, "duration": 0.8}}, {"id": 99, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 100, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你没点灯。", "name": "瓦列里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2266_1#10$1"}, {"id": 101, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "是不愿意再让我看见火？", "name": "瓦列里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2266_1#10$1"}, {"id": 102, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_447_1#1$1", "bstart": 0.2, "bend": 0.6}}, {"id": 103, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "圣徒卡门"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_447_1#1$1"}, {"id": 104, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2266_1#10$1", "bstart": 0.2, "bend": 0.6}}, {"id": 105, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "这是某种软弱的柔情，还是无谓的顾虑？看不见火，我的疼痛也不会少。", "name": "瓦列里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2266_1#10$1"}, {"id": 106, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "毕竟，我身上的火，熄灭不了。", "name": "瓦列里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2266_1#10$1"}, {"id": 107, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 108, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_clothmovement", "volume": 1.0}}, {"id": 109, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.02, "r": 0.25, "g": 0.25, "b": 0.8, "fadetime": 0.2, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 110, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.2, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 111, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2266_1#1$2", "duration": 0.8}}, {"id": 112, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.8, "block": "false"}}, {"id": 113, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 114, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "所以，卡门，你又是来做什么的？", "name": "瓦列里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2266_1#1$2"}, {"id": 115, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_447_1#8$1"}}, {"id": 116, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我会常来。你不必每次都这样找话题。", "name": "圣徒卡门"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_447_1#8$1"}, {"id": 117, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2266_1#11$2"}}, {"id": 118, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "还会有其他人来吗？我会像之前那只海嗣那样，成为给新任审判官坚定信念用的“教具”吗？", "name": "瓦列里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2266_1#11$2"}, {"id": 119, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_447_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 120, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "现在的伊比利亚，最不需要的就是审判他人的信念。", "name": "圣徒卡门"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_447_1#1$1"}, {"id": 121, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "要重新成为泰拉的港口，港都还有很多建设工作亟待完成。", "name": "圣徒卡门"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_447_1#1$1"}, {"id": 122, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_447_1#7$1"}}, {"id": 123, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "一支新的舰队很快将会下水。它们的船帆不需镶金绣银的装饰，但需要能支撑它们航向黄金时代的人们也不曾触及的远海。", "name": "圣徒卡门"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_447_1#7$1"}, {"id": 124, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_447_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 125, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "在那之后，伊比利亚会重新向泰拉打开大门。", "name": "圣徒卡门"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_447_1#1$1"}, {"id": 126, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2266_1#10$2"}}, {"id": 127, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你要如何应对北方边境上那支你无权掌控的军队？几十年来，国防军始终坚信，真正的威胁来自北方的异国人。", "name": "瓦列里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2266_1#10$2"}, {"id": 128, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_447_1#2$1"}}, {"id": 129, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "他们也同是伊比利亚人。而在过去的几十年间，没有伊比利亚人真的对这片土地的状况感到满意。", "name": "圣徒卡门"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_447_1#2$1"}, {"id": 130, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_447_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 131, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "既然如此，他们就一定也会接受改变……以某种方式。", "name": "圣徒卡门"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_447_1#1$1"}, {"id": 132, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2266_1#13$2"}}, {"id": 133, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你很清楚，伊比利亚人的这种“改变”，也可能以把你挂上绞架收尾。", "name": "瓦列里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2266_1#13$2"}, {"id": 134, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_447_1#8$1"}}, {"id": 135, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "港都中心城区升起的那一刻，人们是什么反应，你亲眼看到了。", "name": "圣徒卡门"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_447_1#8$1"}, {"id": 136, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_447_1#8$1"}}, {"id": 137, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "那你也该清楚，从此往后，他们可以不为了救赎和审判而活。他们可以简简单单地，只是去追求好的事物。", "name": "圣徒卡门"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_447_1#8$1"}, {"id": 138, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_447_1#9$1"}}, {"id": 139, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "把我挂上绞架，想必不在其列。", "name": "圣徒卡门"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_447_1#9$1"}, {"id": 140, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2266_1#10$2"}}, {"id": 141, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "那审判庭呢，这个承载了荣光和罪孽的组织，你要如何向敬仰你的人们解释他们手上的灯火会逐渐暗淡？", "name": "瓦列里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2266_1#10$2"}, {"id": 142, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_447_1#5$1"}}, {"id": 143, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "这件事，我已经找到了最合适的处理人选。", "name": "圣徒卡门"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_447_1#5$1"}, {"id": 144, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2266_1#11$2"}}, {"id": 145, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你是说斐戴拉？呵，你真是变得仁慈了，竟然没有将她革职。", "name": "瓦列里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2266_1#11$2"}, {"id": 146, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_447_1#5$1"}}, {"id": 147, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "她深谙决心被动摇后的苦痛，她会替我走遍伊比利亚，为那些同样痛苦的士兵解惑，为他们指引方向。", "name": "圣徒卡门"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_447_1#5$1"}, {"id": 148, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2266_1#10$2"}}, {"id": 149, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我甚至不知你是真的相信这些，还是仅仅给自己漫长煎熬之后的最终解脱找了个借口。", "name": "瓦列里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2266_1#10$2"}, {"id": 150, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2266_1#10$2"}}, {"id": 151, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你幻想的所有这些前景，你都不会亲眼见证，是吗？", "name": "瓦列里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2266_1#10$2"}, {"id": 152, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_447_1#5$1"}}, {"id": 153, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "圣徒卡门"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_447_1#5$1"}, {"id": 154, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2266_1#12$2"}}, {"id": 155, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "也无妨。我这颗人造的心脏，不会停止跳动。", "name": "瓦列里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2266_1#12$2"}, {"id": 156, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2266_1#1$2"}}, {"id": 157, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "如果伊比利亚步入歧途，我会纠正。", "name": "瓦列里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2266_1#1$2"}, {"id": 158, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 159, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 160, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 161, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 162, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 163, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "74_g11_clmsoffice", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 164, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 165, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$blizzard", "volume": 0.0, "channel": "f", "loop": "true"}}, {"id": 166, "prop": "SoundVolume", "attributes": {"volume": 0.5, "channel": "f", "fadetime": 1.0}}, {"id": 167, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_sea", "volume": 0.0, "channel": "sea", "loop": "true"}}, {"id": 168, "prop": "SoundVolume", "attributes": {"volume": 1.0, "channel": "sea", "fadetime": 1.0}}, {"id": 169, "prop": "Subtitle", "attributes": {"text": "“一如曾经那般，伊比利亚人又一次与海中的来客并肩而立。”", "multi": "true", "x": 300.0, "y": 350.0, "alignment": "center", "size": 24.0, "delay": 0.04, "width": 700.0}}, {"id": 170, "prop": "subtitle", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 171, "prop": "Subtitle", "attributes": {"text": "“只不过这一次，他们不会再互相误解。他们终于在对方身上，看到了自己的模样。”", "multi": "true", "x": 300.0, "y": 350.0, "alignment": "center", "size": 24.0, "delay": 0.04, "width": 700.0}}, {"id": 172, "prop": "subtitle", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 173, "prop": "Subtitle", "attributes": {"text": "“那本就是同一副面孔——人的面孔。”", "multi": "true", "x": 300.0, "y": 350.0, "alignment": "center", "size": 24.0, "delay": 0.04, "width": 700.0}}, {"id": 174, "prop": "subtitle", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 175, "prop": "StopSound", "attributes": {"channel": "f", "fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 176, "prop": "StopSound", "attributes": {"channel": "sea", "fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 177, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 178, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 179, "prop": "playMusic", "attributes": {"intro": "$farce_intro", "key": "$farce_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 180, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2267_1#5$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 181, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_1401_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 182, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你这地方真没漏水吗？还是说你们阿戈尔人就算漏水了也没关系，反正你们喜欢泡在水里？在水里面还建大浴场，是真事儿？", "name": "德鲁莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2267_1#5$1"}, {"id": 183, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_microrobot"}}, {"id": 184, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 185, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "克莱门莎监事的办公室采用了阿戈尔的最新建筑材料和分子合成技术，它能——", "name": "小帮手"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1401_1#1$1"}, {"id": 186, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2267_1#8$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 187, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "行了行了，克莱门莎监事，你不能让它消停一点吗？", "name": "德鲁莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2267_1#8$1"}, {"id": 188, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 189, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 190, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 191, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你们相处得不是很融洽吗？我原来还打算把这台小帮手送给你。", "name": "克莱门莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#1$1"}, {"id": 192, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2267_1#4$1"}}, {"id": 193, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……别吧。", "name": "德鲁莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2267_1#4$1"}, {"id": 194, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2267_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 195, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "行了，说说吧，找我什么事？你最近应该在为岛民的事费心费力才对。", "name": "德鲁莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2267_1#1$1"}, {"id": 196, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#5$1"}}, {"id": 197, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我想向你提出一项邀请。", "name": "克莱门莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#5$1"}, {"id": 198, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2267_1#5$1"}}, {"id": 199, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我可不要去阿戈尔啊，在陆地上待惯了，太潮的话我就不得不每周清扫房间了，不然会长蘑菇。", "name": "德鲁莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2267_1#5$1"}, {"id": 200, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#5$1"}}, {"id": 201, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不是迁移邀请，是雇佣邀请。", "name": "克莱门莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#5$1"}, {"id": 202, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#5$1"}}, {"id": 203, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我已和伊比利亚阁下商议，将以雷亚-伊比利亚为据点，建立一支能正当地出现在任何地方，处理任何问题的力量——“陆巡队”。", "name": "克莱门莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#5$1"}, {"id": 204, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#12$1"}}, {"id": 205, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我提议，由你来担任队长。", "name": "克莱门莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#12$1"}, {"id": 206, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2267_1#5$1"}}, {"id": 207, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我？", "name": "德鲁莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2267_1#5$1"}, {"id": 208, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#5$1"}}, {"id": 209, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "嗯。", "name": "克莱门莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#5$1"}, {"id": 210, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2267_1#5$1"}}, {"id": 211, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "队长？", "name": "德鲁莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2267_1#5$1"}, {"id": 212, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 213, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "没错。", "name": "克莱门莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#1$1"}, {"id": 214, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2267_1#7$1"}}, {"id": 215, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "听起来很费力。", "name": "德鲁莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2267_1#7$1"}, {"id": 216, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#15$1"}}, {"id": 217, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你可以拒绝我的邀请。", "name": "克莱门莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#15$1"}, {"id": 218, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2267_1#9$1"}}, {"id": 219, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你们水里的阿戈尔人这么不懂人情世故吗？我只需要你给我个台阶下。", "name": "德鲁莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2267_1#9$1"}, {"id": 220, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#5$1"}}, {"id": 221, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "需要台阶的话……我确实代伊比利亚阁下，给你捎来了一样东西。", "name": "克莱门莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#5$1"}, {"id": 222, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 223, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 224, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_clothmovement", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 225, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 226, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2267_1#5$1"}}, {"id": 227, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "刻了经文的手炮弹药？我以为他们只会给立了功的审判官发这玩意？", "name": "德鲁莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2267_1#5$1"}, {"id": 228, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#6$1"}}, {"id": 229, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "想来是不合你的心意。", "name": "克莱门莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#6$1"}, {"id": 230, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2267_1#10$1"}}, {"id": 231, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "这么形式主义又麻烦的东西，不如我回去路上顺手帮你扔了。", "name": "德鲁莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2267_1#10$1"}, {"id": 232, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 233, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "小帮手有很便捷的垃圾处理功能。", "name": "克莱门莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#1$1"}, {"id": 234, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2267_1#5$1"}}, {"id": 235, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "德鲁莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2267_1#5$1"}, {"id": 236, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 237, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "噗，开玩笑的。收好吧，过去你无法成为审判庭正规军的一员，但至少现在伊比利亚会认可你的付出，而将来阿戈尔也会。", "name": "克莱门莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#1$1"}, {"id": 238, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2267_1#2$1"}}, {"id": 239, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不愧是有过执政经历的人啊，真会说话。", "name": "德鲁莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2267_1#2$1"}, {"id": 240, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2267_1#2$1"}}, {"id": 241, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "把那台跟了我一周的小帮手给我，我就答应你。", "name": "德鲁莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2267_1#2$1"}, {"id": 242, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#5$1"}}, {"id": 243, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "看来你也给了我一个台阶下。", "name": "克莱门莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#5$1"}, {"id": 244, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 245, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "成交。", "name": "克莱门莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#1$1"}, {"id": 246, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_1401_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 247, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "小帮手"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1401_1#1$1"}, {"id": 248, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#5$1"}}, {"id": 249, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我们合作愉快。", "name": "克莱门莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#5$1"}, {"id": 250, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 251, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 252, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 253, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_gen_walk_n", "volume": 1.0}}, {"id": 254, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2267_1#2$1", "posfrom": "0,0", "posto": "160,0", "afrom": 1.0, "ato": 0.0, "duration": 1.5}}, {"id": 255, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 256, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 257, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 258, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_gen_transmissionget", "volume": 1.0}}, {"id": 259, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 260, "prop": "playMusic", "attributes": {"intro": "$m_dia_street_intro", "key": "$m_dia_street_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 261, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 262, "prop": "interlude", "attributes": {"maskid": "group_interclude_vertical_common", "size": "290,760", "tsfrom": "0,1", "tsto": "1,1", "tsduration": 0.5, "switch": "true", "style": 0.0, "offset": "-250,0", "channel": 3.0}}, {"id": 263, "prop": "interlude", "attributes": {"channel": 3.0, "switch": "true", "type": 3.0, "slot": "m", "pfrom": "-250,0", "pto": "-250,0", "name": "avgnew_474_gladiia_1#4$2", "duration": 0.0}}, {"id": 264, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 0.5}}, {"id": 265, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "接通了。那么，防线与陆地之间的通讯应该已经完全恢复了。", "name": "歌蕾蒂娅"}}, {"id": 266, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "先前截断通讯的那批海嗣，正裹挟着大量其他生物，沿海岸线向北逃窜。但海巡队目前为止没有发现深海主教奥卢斯的踪影。", "name": "歌蕾蒂娅"}}, {"id": 267, "prop": "interlude", "attributes": {"channel": 3.0, "switch": "false"}}, {"id": 268, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#5$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 269, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……了解。", "name": "克莱门莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#5$1"}, {"id": 270, "prop": "interlude", "attributes": {"channel": 3.0, "switch": "true", "type": 3.0, "slot": "m", "pfrom": "-250,0", "pto": "-250,0", "name": "avgnew_474_gladiia_1#1$2", "duration": 0.0}}, {"id": 271, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 272, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你不追问？", "name": "歌蕾蒂娅"}}, {"id": 273, "prop": "interlude", "attributes": {"channel": 3.0, "switch": "false"}}, {"id": 274, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 275, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "追问一个生命由不得自己做主的囚徒？", "name": "克莱门莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1"}, {"id": 276, "prop": "interlude", "attributes": {"channel": 3.0, "switch": "true", "type": 3.0, "slot": "m", "pfrom": "-250,0", "pto": "-250,0", "name": "avgnew_474_gladiia_1#1$2", "duration": 0.0}}, {"id": 277, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 278, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "看来我们收到的行动报告是润色之后的版本，我想你不用我提醒你这样做的后果。", "name": "歌蕾蒂娅"}}, {"id": 279, "prop": "interlude", "attributes": {"channel": 3.0, "switch": "false"}}, {"id": 280, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#5$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 281, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "当然。", "name": "克莱门莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#5$1"}, {"id": 282, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我能告诉你的是，等到时机合适的时候，遍布海嗣的近海会在一段时间内净空，为阿戈尔、为泰拉、为罗德岛开辟通往泰拉背面的道路。", "name": "克莱门莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#5$1"}, {"id": 283, "prop": "interlude", "attributes": {"channel": 3.0, "switch": "true", "type": 3.0, "slot": "m", "pfrom": "-250,0", "pto": "-250,0", "name": "avgnew_474_gladiia_1#5$2", "duration": 0.0}}, {"id": 284, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 285, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "代价是什么？", "name": "歌蕾蒂娅"}}, {"id": 286, "prop": "interlude", "attributes": {"channel": 3.0, "switch": "false"}}, {"id": 287, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#10$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 288, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "对于阿戈尔而言，一座已经被放弃，也不再具有功能的火山能源站的移动权限，应该算不上什么代价。", "name": "克莱门莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#10$1"}, {"id": 289, "prop": "interlude", "attributes": {"channel": 3.0, "switch": "true", "type": 3.0, "slot": "m", "pfrom": "-250,0", "pto": "-250,0", "name": "avgnew_474_gladiia_1#5$2", "duration": 0.0}}, {"id": 290, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 291, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你跟奥卢斯做了交易。", "name": "歌蕾蒂娅"}}, {"id": 292, "prop": "interlude", "attributes": {"channel": 3.0, "switch": "false"}}, {"id": 293, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 294, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我不会对你隐瞒，歌蕾蒂娅。", "name": "克莱门莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1"}, {"id": 295, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "以他的罪行，他无权向阿戈尔、向我们索要什么，但他也在寻找一种通向未来的可能，而且这笔交易也对战局有利。", "name": "克莱门莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1"}, {"id": 296, "prop": "interlude", "attributes": {"channel": 3.0, "switch": "true", "type": 3.0, "slot": "m", "pfrom": "-250,0", "pto": "-250,0", "name": "avgnew_474_gladiia_1#4$2", "duration": 0.0}}, {"id": 297, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 298, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你在赌我不会告发你？", "name": "歌蕾蒂娅"}}, {"id": 299, "prop": "interlude", "attributes": {"channel": 3.0, "switch": "false"}}, {"id": 300, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#5$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 301, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "以我们的交情，我不用把这样的事放上赌桌，不是吗？", "name": "克莱门莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#5$1"}, {"id": 302, "prop": "interlude", "attributes": {"channel": 3.0, "switch": "true", "type": 3.0, "slot": "m", "pfrom": "-250,0", "pto": "-250,0", "name": "avgnew_474_gladiia_1#1$2", "duration": 0.0}}, {"id": 303, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 304, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……我会等你们的交易兑现，再做出判断。", "name": "歌蕾蒂娅"}}, {"id": 305, "prop": "interlude", "attributes": {"channel": 3.0, "switch": "false"}}, {"id": 306, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#5$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 307, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "谢谢。", "name": "克莱门莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#5$1"}, {"id": 308, "prop": "interlude", "attributes": {"channel": 3.0, "switch": "true", "type": 3.0, "slot": "m", "pfrom": "-250,0", "pto": "-250,0", "name": "avgnew_474_gladiia_1#1$2", "duration": 0.0}}, {"id": 309, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 310, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "所以，这是你赢下与赫拉提娅的赌约之后，仍要正式辞去执政官一职的原因？", "name": "歌蕾蒂娅"}}, {"id": 311, "prop": "interlude", "attributes": {"channel": 3.0, "switch": "false"}}, {"id": 312, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 313, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我想我不用解释，这绝不意味着背叛。", "name": "克莱门莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1"}, {"id": 314, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "哪怕我对阿戈尔的方针仍存有疑虑，甚至怀有近乎悲观的态度，我也希望那个由阿戈尔抚养至此的克莱门莎，尊重它现有的规则。", "name": "克莱门莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1"}, {"id": 315, "prop": "interlude", "attributes": {"channel": 3.0, "switch": "true", "type": 3.0, "slot": "m", "pfrom": "-250,0", "pto": "-250,0", "name": "avgnew_474_gladiia_1#4$2", "duration": 0.0}}, {"id": 316, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 317, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你跟在弥利亚留姆的时候不一样了。又或者你早就不一样了，只是默默验证着你的理念，很久很久。", "name": "歌蕾蒂娅"}}, {"id": 318, "prop": "interlude", "attributes": {"channel": 3.0, "switch": "false"}}, {"id": 319, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#5$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 320, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "放心，我与深海猎人的合作关系还在，之后陆巡队也会正式建立与阿戈尔的联系。", "name": "克莱门莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#5$1"}, {"id": 321, "prop": "interlude", "attributes": {"channel": 3.0, "switch": "true", "type": 3.0, "slot": "m", "pfrom": "-250,0", "pto": "-250,0", "name": "avgnew_474_gladiia_1#1$2", "duration": 0.0}}, {"id": 322, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 323, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "离开阿戈尔后，你用礼貌掩饰真心的次数倒是减少了。", "name": "歌蕾蒂娅"}}, {"id": 324, "prop": "interlude", "attributes": {"channel": 3.0, "switch": "false"}}, {"id": 325, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#7$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 326, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "嗯……？", "name": "克莱门莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#7$1"}, {"id": 327, "prop": "interlude", "attributes": {"channel": 3.0, "switch": "true", "type": 3.0, "slot": "m", "pfrom": "-250,0", "pto": "-250,0", "name": "avgnew_474_gladiia_1#1$2", "duration": 0.0}}, {"id": 328, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 329, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "没事。", "name": "歌蕾蒂娅"}}, {"id": 330, "prop": "interlude", "attributes": {"channel": 3.0, "switch": "false"}}, {"id": 331, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 332, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我们需要互通有无的信息，就是这些了，对吗？", "name": "克莱门莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1"}, {"id": 333, "prop": "interlude", "attributes": {"channel": 3.0, "switch": "true", "type": 3.0, "slot": "m", "pfrom": "-250,0", "pto": "-250,0", "name": "avgnew_474_gladiia_1#1$2", "duration": 0.0}}, {"id": 334, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 335, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "目前为止。", "name": "歌蕾蒂娅"}}, {"id": 336, "prop": "interlude", "attributes": {"channel": 3.0, "switch": "false"}}, {"id": 337, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 338, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "那么请容我消失一段时间。接下来的四十八小时内，如果没法联系到我，都属于正常情况。", "name": "克莱门莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#1$1"}, {"id": 339, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 340, "prop": "interlude", "attributes": {"channel": 3.0, "switch": "true", "type": 3.0, "slot": "m", "pfrom": "-250,0", "pto": "-250,0", "name": "avgnew_474_gladiia_1#3$2", "duration": 0.0}}, {"id": 341, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 342, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你又要……", "name": "歌蕾蒂娅"}}, {"id": 343, "prop": "interlude", "attributes": {"channel": 3.0, "switch": "false"}}, {"id": 344, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#5$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 345, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "嗯。", "name": "克莱门莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#5$1"}, {"id": 346, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 347, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$transmission", "volume": 1.0}}, {"id": 348, "prop": "interlude", "attributes": {"channel": 3.0, "clear": "true"}}, {"id": 349, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 350, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#11$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 351, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "呼……", "name": "克莱门莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#11$1"}, {"id": 352, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 353, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 354, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 355, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_higheldshosfts"}}, {"id": 356, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 4.0}}, {"id": 357, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_sit_tatami"}}, {"id": 358, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.5}}, {"id": 359, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 360, "prop": "Image", "attributes": {"image": "74_i07", "screenadapt": "coverall", "xScale": 1.3, "yScale": 1.3, "x": 100.0, "y": 100.0, "fadetime": 0.0}}, {"id": 361, "prop": "ImageTween", "attributes": {"duration": 40.0, "block": "false"}}, {"id": 362, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "false"}}, {"id": 363, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 364, "prop": "playMusic", "attributes": {"key": "$saferoom_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 365, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "该做的，应该暂时都做好了……", "name": "克莱门莎"}}, {"id": 366, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "也是时候给技术院的朋友提交些使用反馈了……按摩的力度，不管怎么说都还是太小了。", "name": "克莱门莎"}}, {"id": 367, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "以及……明明之前用起来都没什么问题，这次总感觉缺了些什么……", "name": "克莱门莎"}}, {"id": 368, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "思索片刻，克莱门莎还是向小帮手下了命令。"}}, {"id": 369, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "小帮手，重新启用健康监测模块。", "name": "克莱门莎"}}, {"id": 370, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_activation"}}, {"id": 371, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "——但请不要影响按摩功能。", "name": "克莱门莎"}}, {"id": 372, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "然后，她安稳地闭上了眼。"}}, {"id": 373, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_heartratemonitor"}}, {"id": 374, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "警告，您的心电结果存在异常，右束支传导存在轻度阻滞，建议……", "name": "小帮手"}}, {"id": 375, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "警告，您的全身射线影像结果存在异常，系长期劳损导致的尾骨错位，建议……", "name": "小帮手"}}, {"id": 376, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "警告，您的鳍肢组织超声结果存在异常，于头鳍处发现性质尚不明确的结节，建议……", "name": "小帮手"}}, {"id": 377, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "小帮手的警告声不绝于耳，那是克莱门莎刻意忽视了数年之久的现实。"}}, {"id": 378, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 379, "prop": "Image", "attributes": {"image": "74_i07", "screenadapt": "coverall", "xScale": 1.05, "yScale": 1.05, "fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 380, "prop": "ImageTween", "attributes": {"xScaleFrom": 1.05, "yScaleFrom": 1.05, "xScaleTo": 1.0, "yScaleTo": 1.0, "xTo": 0.0, "yTo": 0.0, "duration": 20.0, "block": "false"}}, {"id": 381, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 3.0}}, {"id": 382, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "伊比利亚、阿戈尔、陆巡队、罗德岛、港口、未知海域……她要处理的事情还有很多，但幸运的是，她还有时间，也有支持她的人。"}}, {"id": 383, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "一切都能留给明天，不，是后天再去操心。"}}, {"id": 384, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 385, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 386, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 387, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 388, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 389, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 390, "prop": "Image", "attributes": {}}], "OPTIONTRACE": true}